# ===================================================================
# Stage 1 — YOLOv11-det (Layout Segmentation)
# Classes: Isometric / PMI / Table / Text / View  (5 classes, D-028)
# Source: IMMA.v1i.yolov11/data.yaml (Roboflow export, jihyunghans-workspace)
# Format: Ultralytics YOLO det dataset YAML
# ===================================================================
#
# Mapping to internal canonical names (D-029, applied in src/stage1_layout.py):
#   Roboflow         Internal
#   ─────────        ────────
#   Isometric   →    Isometric    (NEW)
#   PMI         →    PMI          (NEW, Stage 2 OBB target)
#   Table       →    TitleBlock   (semantic preservation)
#   Text        →    Notes        (semantic preservation)
#   View        →    View
#
# Dataset root (절대 경로 권장. 상대 경로일 경우 ultralytics가 settings.yaml의
# 'datasets_dir' 기준으로 해석함)
# 환경에 맞게 아래 중 하나로 조정:
#   WSL2 (Windows mount):  /mnt/c/Users/user/github/Drawing/IMMA.v1i.yolov11
#   Linux native:          /home/<user>/Drawing/IMMA.v1i.yolov11
#   Windows native:        C:/Users/user/github/Drawing/IMMA.v1i.yolov11
# 폴더 구조 (Roboflow v1 export, 80/20 split):
#   IMMA.v1i.yolov11/
#     ├── train/{images,labels}/   ← 80장
#     ├── valid/{images,labels}/   ← 20장
#     └── data.yaml                ← Roboflow 원본 (참고용)
path: /mnt/c/Use